---
// Buttondown redirects here after the confirmation link is clicked
// (Settings: subscription confirmation redirect URL).
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="You're signed up" description="Your email signup for FedCourtsAI updates is confirmed." noindex>
  <h1>You're signed up</h1>
  <p>
    Emails come from <code>updates@fedcourts.ai</code>. If you ticked the weekly Supreme Court update, it arrives most
    weeks, skipping weeks with nothing to report. Everyone also gets an email when there's a new release, about two to
    four times a year. Every email has an unsubscribe link and a link to your preferences, where you can change which
    updates you get.
  </p>
  <p>
    In the meantime, the <a href="/">board</a> shows what the models are predicting now, and scored releases are
    published on the <a href="/results">results page</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
